sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as SSE client
    participant H as HTTP handler
    participant F as stream fanout hub
    participant M as notification multiplexer
    participant S as PageReader
    participant R as Redis
    C->>H: GET offset and live=sse
    H->>F: acquire provisional stream hub
    F->>M: register logical channel
    M->>R: SUBSCRIBE on one physical connection
    R-->>M: acknowledge current generation
    M-->>F: registration ready
    H->>S: first ReadPage captures incarnation and exact tail
    H->>F: initialize with captured stream lifetime
    F-->>H: hub ready from first page · no readiness reread
    loop pages to captured tail
        H->>S: continuation ReadPage with same snapshot
        H-->>C: data then control offset under write deadline
    end
    H->>S: no-touch stream identity confirmation
    H->>F: indexed attach at last flushed control offset
    Note over H,F: no gap between catch-up and live delivery
    R-->>M: append wake hint
    M-->>F: coalesced nonblocking wake
    F->>S: page one new durable tail once
    F-->>H: shared immutable data event
    H-->>C: shared data then client control
